  // trust panel: money direction, steps, what needs checking, approximate meaning
  tagline: ["Understand it. Know what's due. Get it done.", 'Verstehen. Wissen, was fällig ist. Erledigen.', "Comprendre. Savoir ce qui est dû. Le faire.", 'Entiéndalo. Sepa qué toca. Hágalo.', 'Capisci. Sai cosa scade. Fallo.', 'Perceba. Saiba o que tem de fazer. Faça.'],
